Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:30.54,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&66AF66&}几何学模型 推导的结果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:34.90,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&66AF66&}会是和谁相遇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:41.55,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&60AFDF&\an3}小指上系着的丝线是何颜色？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.55,0:22:47.07,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&60AFDF&\an1}用恋爱的色 仔细重新染过吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:49.74,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&CFAF88&\blur4\an1}你对我的「喜欢」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:52.69,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\3c&CFAF88&\blur4\an1}改变了我的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.69,0:22:53.19,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\3c&EAB0FF&\blur4\an1}改变了我的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.99,0:22:55.89,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&EAB0FF&\blur4}「不想说什么任性的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.89,0:22:58.95,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&EAB0FF&\blur4}但是……不希望你的这些话变成回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:00.68,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&EAB0FF&\blur4}所以拜托了」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.80,0:23:03.54,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&EAB0FF&\blur4}和我恋爱吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.88,0:23:06.59,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}你看 Run run run! 一直奔向你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:09.37,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}然后呢！？Kiss or hug 就算强硬点也正好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.37,0:23:14.48,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}在满月之夜 愿你喜欢我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:17.53,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}你一定 Be my love 我相信你会的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.53,0:23:20.51,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4}选择吧 Love or love 答案只能是我吧？
