Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:27.39,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&667ADF&\blur4}所以 还请神明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.39,0:23:31.55,edcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\3c&667ADF&\blur4}早点给他降下旨意吧
